            "sid": "EXO 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Haruni, “Una jeeda dareapcheeda roonyeewana Musa.” Hean gawa, ak gwaroonyi niny aba giijeeda ASEETA ak ghwasam gheata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa Musa Haruni ng'asheega sean ajeakteawa NG'UTAMIIDA niny, ea gwadeagwajeega sean sirukusa niny gawa gwasin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeay Musa ea Haruni ak ghabwada geat gweargwa sean bea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukuta Haruni ng'asheega sean ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ak gwasin gwadeagwajeega aba madeeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghamwas buuneeda, hean nea geayiiy gideaba nibareasa NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli, ea gideaba nidaah sawanadeeda nyaawa, hean gabuy iheenga nyaawa ak geaghadoawan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
